   *
   * This operation provides comprehensive search and filtering capabilities for browsing organizations. Organizations serve as the primary business container within the platform, representing distinct companies or business units that operate independently. Each organization functions as a self-contained workspace where all employees, projects, tasks, time tracking data, and business operations are managed.
   *
   * The endpoint supports searching by organization name using partial matching, filtering by organization status (active or deleted), and sorting by various fields including creation date, update date, or name. Pagination is implemented to handle large result sets efficiently.
