   *
   * Implementation steps:
   * 1. Validate the organizationId parameter as a valid UUID format
   * 2. Execute SELECT query on hrm_platform_organizations WHERE id = organizationId AND deleted_at IS NULL
   * 3. Verify the requesting user has permission to access this organization (must be member or admin with access to this organization)
   * 4. Return the organization record with all fields including owner reference
   * 5. Handle soft-deleted organizations by returning 404 Not Found if deleted_at is not NULL
   * 6. Enforce organization context isolation - users can only access organizations they belong to
   * 7. Return 404 Not Found if organization does not exist or user lacks access permissions
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
