  /**
   * Create a point-in-time snapshot of a project for audit trail and historical tracking purposes.
   *
   * This operation captures the complete state of a project at a specific moment in time, preserving all project fields including name, description, status, color code, and budget hours. The snapshot is immutable once created and serves as a historical record for compliance, recovery, and audit purposes.
   *
   * Project snapshots are typically created automatically by the system when significant changes occur, but this endpoint allows authorized users with project management permissions to manually trigger snapshot creation for audit compliance or before major project modifications.
