   * The snapshot includes denormalized copies of all project fields, ensuring that the historical state is preserved even if the original project is later modified or deleted. Each snapshot is associated with the creating user and timestamped for audit trail purposes.
   *
   * Related operations include viewing project snapshots (GET /projects/{projectId}/snapshots) and retrieving individual snapshot details (GET /projects/{projectId}/snapshots/{snapshotId}).
