   * - Apply task filter on hrm_platform_task_id (equality, must belong to filtered project)
   * - Apply billable filter on billable column (equality)
   * - Apply employee filter on hrm_platform_employee_id (equality, only if user has time view all permission)
   *
   * Pagination:
   * - Use cursor-based or offset-based pagination
   * - Default page size: 20, maximum: 100
   * - Sort by date descending by default (most recent first)
   * - Support custom sorting on date, duration, project_id
   *
   * Data Retrieval:
   * - Join with hrm_platform_projects for project name
   * - Join with hrm_platform_tasks for task name (optional)
   * - Join with hrm_platform_employees for employee name (if viewing all)
   * - Exclude soft-deleted timelogs (deleted_at IS NULL)
   *
   * Validation:
   * - Ensure date range is valid (end_date >= start_date)
   * - Ensure task_id belongs to project_id if both specified
   * - Ensure employee_id belongs to current organization
   *
   * Return paginated response with total count and summary data.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
