   * This operation allows authorized users to modify timelog entries that have not been locked by timesheet approval. Employees can edit their own timelogs as long as they are not part of an approved timesheet. Users with time management permissions can modify any employee's timelogs regardless of timesheet status.
   *
   * The timelog date field is immutable once created and cannot be modified through this operation. If you need to correct a date entry, the timelog must be deleted and recreated with the correct date (subject to deletion constraints).
   *
   * Security and permissions are enforced based on the timelog's timesheet status:
   * - Timelogs in approved timesheets are completely immutable
   * - Timelogs in submitted timesheets can only be edited by users with time management permissions
   * - Timelogs in draft timesheets or without timesheet association can be edited by the employee owner
